  <metadata>
    <name>Mare de Déu del Mont Loop</name>
    <desc>Challenging Girona loop centred on the notorious Mare de Déu del Mont climb — 18km averaging 5.4% with sections hitting 14%. Quiet rolling countryside, forest terrain, and panoramic summit views. Returns via Banyoles lake.</desc>
